[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l033","ordinal":114689,"en":"Leopard Almambet, give your blessing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l034","ordinal":114690,"en":"Let me go against the Chinese!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l035","ordinal":114691,"en":"Syrgak's gray belt"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l036","ordinal":114692,"en":"He fitted about his neck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l037","ordinal":114693,"en":"Asking Bakai for a blessing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l038","ordinal":114694,"en":"Young Syrgak pleaded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0492:b004:l039","ordinal":114695,"en":"Before he could close his mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l001","ordinal":114696,"en":"Destroyer Bakai and Almambet—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l002","ordinal":114697,"en":"To Syrgak beside them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l003","ordinal":114698,"en":"Before they could give their blessing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l004","ordinal":114699,"en":"Roaring in wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l005","ordinal":114700,"en":"Kökchököz came out for single combat:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l006","ordinal":114701,"en":"“Never sated with asking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l007","ordinal":114702,"en":"Never abandoning greed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l008","ordinal":114703,"en":"Kyrgyz sultan, Burut hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l009","ordinal":114704,"en":"Today your questioning will come to an end."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l011","ordinal":114705,"en":"Come to the open ground, Burut."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l012","ordinal":114706,"en":"Not you—your precious Manas has encountered it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l014","ordinal":114707,"en":"He is grievously sick;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l015","ordinal":114708,"en":"Your Manas is pierced in forty places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l016","ordinal":114709,"en":"This is the road the scouts have reconnoitered;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l017","ordinal":114710,"en":"This is the force that kept striking."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l018","ordinal":114711,"en":"Not merely you, my boy Syrgak—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l019","ordinal":114712,"en":"Gray-maned King Manas himself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l020","ordinal":114713,"en":"This is the force that took him.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l021","ordinal":114714,"en":"Speaking thus, Kökchököz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l022","ordinal":114715,"en":"Charged in wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l023","ordinal":114716,"en":"Turning Kertoru's head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l024","ordinal":114717,"en":"His outstretched spear, its head of cast iron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l025","ordinal":114718,"en":"At poor young Syrgak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l026","ordinal":114719,"en":"He thrust with a roar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l027","ordinal":114720,"en":"The unbeliever's wrath poured out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l028","ordinal":114721,"en":"It was not young hero Syrgak—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l029","ordinal":114722,"en":"Alas, it was Bakai whose heart was troubled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l030","ordinal":114723,"en":"For young gray-maned Syrgak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l031","ordinal":114724,"en":"Almambet, Chubak and Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l032","ordinal":114725,"en":"Spread their hands, saying, “Amen!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l033","ordinal":114726,"en":"You were a boy of sixteen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l034","ordinal":114727,"en":"A playful young soul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l035","ordinal":114728,"en":"If you are defeated, it will bring disgrace."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l036","ordinal":114729,"en":"The prince's son"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l037","ordinal":114730,"en":"Is entrusted to the one God!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l038","ordinal":114731,"en":"Against the unbeliever among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b003:l039","ordinal":114732,"en":"Against the skilled one he goes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l001","ordinal":114733,"en":"The renowned man who knows the enemy's tactics."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l002","ordinal":114734,"en":"My Syrgak goes against a champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l003","ordinal":114735,"en":"What almighty Jabbar has decreed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l004","ordinal":114736,"en":"He goes to see."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l005","ordinal":114737,"en":"Among the many renowned Kalmyks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l006","ordinal":114738,"en":"My Syrgak goes to die."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l007","ordinal":114739,"en":"A lone hero whose life is measured—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l008","ordinal":114740,"en":"Will the Chinese cleave him apart?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l009","ordinal":114741,"en":"Creator, you alone, be his helper!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l010","ordinal":114742,"en":"Forty chiltens, my Khizr-Ilyas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l011","ordinal":114743,"en":"Hear our cry and watch over him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l012","ordinal":114744,"en":"Pure Prophet, Ali the Lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l013","ordinal":114745,"en":"Support that little lion there!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l015","ordinal":114746,"en":"Almambet and fortunate Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l016","ordinal":114747,"en":"Spread their hands, saying, “Amen!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l017","ordinal":114748,"en":"The noble ones gave their blessing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l018","ordinal":114749,"en":"As though they would part forever,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l019","ordinal":114750,"en":"The lions grieved for Syrgak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l021","ordinal":114751,"en":"Without looking about him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l022","ordinal":114752,"en":"Renowned Syrgak himself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l023","ordinal":114753,"en":"Swayed out into battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l024","ordinal":114754,"en":"Not sparing his life at all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l025","ordinal":114755,"en":"The renowned young Syrgak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l026","ordinal":114756,"en":"Shouted, “Baba ad-Din!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l027","ordinal":114757,"en":"As he reached the appointed ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l028","ordinal":114758,"en":"As he went to face his opponent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l029","ordinal":114759,"en":"He raised the battle cry, “Manas!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l030","ordinal":114760,"en":"In the bulletproof armor dear Kanykei, your sister-in-law, had made,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l032","ordinal":114761,"en":"He dressed without a gap."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l033","ordinal":114762,"en":"He headed toward the Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l034","ordinal":114763,"en":"Like one seeing his wife's kin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l035","ordinal":114764,"en":"That fine fellow smiled broadly, laughing in delight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l037","ordinal":114765,"en":"Extending his spear, untroubled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l038","ordinal":114766,"en":"Syrgak went forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0493:b004:l039","ordinal":114767,"en":"Toward the dark Kalmyk before him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l001","ordinal":114768,"en":"Not considering him worth a trouser-leg."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l002","ordinal":114769,"en":"Courage and lion-heartedness"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l003","ordinal":114770,"en":"To young gray-maned Syrgak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l004","ordinal":114771,"en":"Allah the Creator"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l005","ordinal":114772,"en":"Had given without measure."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l006","ordinal":114773,"en":"He looked neither up nor down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l007","ordinal":114774,"en":"Have you seen his recklessness?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l008","ordinal":114775,"en":"The boy did not think of dying."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l009","ordinal":114776,"en":"The boy shrank not at all from death;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l010","ordinal":114777,"en":"He never fled an enemy in battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l011","ordinal":114778,"en":"Then Syrgak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l012","ordinal":114779,"en":"Turned Kökchebich's head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l013","ordinal":114780,"en":"Kökchököz, like Opol Mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l014","ordinal":114781,"en":"Thrust his spear with a roar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l015","ordinal":114782,"en":"Kökchököz, like Opol Mountain—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l016","ordinal":114783,"en":"Let me tell of that gray-maned hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l017","ordinal":114784,"en":"Teminori tepilal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l018","ordinal":114785,"en":"The great hair at his nape"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l019","ordinal":114786,"en":"Shook like a mallet."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l020","ordinal":114787,"en":"Dust rose from his wrath;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l021","ordinal":114788,"en":"Lives fled before the unbeliever's might."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l022","ordinal":114789,"en":"He had six battle-axes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l023","ordinal":114790,"en":"One to replace another if it broke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l024","ordinal":114791,"en":"Tied to his cotton belt."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l025","ordinal":114792,"en":"He had three spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l026","ordinal":114793,"en":"Two laid beneath his thighs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l027","ordinal":114794,"en":"A blue spear some forty fathoms long"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l028","ordinal":114795,"en":"He thrust firmly with a roar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l029","ordinal":114796,"en":"Ready there at his hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l030","ordinal":114797,"en":"Beneath Kökchököz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l031","ordinal":114798,"en":"Was his winged steed Kertoru."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l032","ordinal":114799,"en":"The imposing Kökchököz—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l033","ordinal":114800,"en":"Not merely young Syrgak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l034","ordinal":114801,"en":"He had strength to destroy the world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l035","ordinal":114802,"en":"Blood flowed at the news of him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l036","ordinal":114803,"en":"Your uncle came forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l037","ordinal":114804,"en":"Lives fleeing before his might."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l038","ordinal":114805,"en":"He arrived before an arrow could."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b003:l039","ordinal":114806,"en":"Accomplished, renowned Syrgak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l001","ordinal":114807,"en":"As he reached the Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l002","ordinal":114808,"en":"Struck him squarely on the jaw and passed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l003","ordinal":114809,"en":"It rang out, but he paid no heed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l004","ordinal":114810,"en":"Hero Syrgak's thrust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l005","ordinal":114811,"en":"Mighty Kökchököz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l006","ordinal":114812,"en":"Counted as less than a trouser-leg."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l007","ordinal":114813,"en":"Before Syrgak could rein in Kökchebich,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l008","ordinal":114814,"en":"The nimble gray-maned Kökchököz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l009","ordinal":114815,"en":"His blue spear forty fathoms long"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l010","ordinal":114816,"en":"Thrust toward him with a shout."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l011","ordinal":114817,"en":"Syrgak, leaning to one side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l012","ordinal":114818,"en":"He charged up to and struck."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l013","ordinal":114819,"en":"The spear's terrible impact—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l014","ordinal":114820,"en":"He toppled, disappearing from sight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l015","ordinal":114821,"en":"“O Almighty, protect me!” he cried."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l016","ordinal":114822,"en":"Your Syrgak, Kökchebich's sacred mane"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l017","ordinal":114823,"en":"Barely caught, and righted himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l018","ordinal":114824,"en":"Upon Syrgak, barely staying upright,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l019","ordinal":114825,"en":"Kökchököz inflicted torment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l020","ordinal":114826,"en":"Broad-mouthed, painted arrows—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l021","ordinal":114827,"en":"Kökchököz took it up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l022","ordinal":114828,"en":"And fired forty times with it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l023","ordinal":114829,"en":"The gray arrow with steel bullets—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l024","ordinal":114830,"en":"With this he fired four times."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l025","ordinal":114831,"en":"Renowned young Syrgak's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l026","ordinal":114832,"en":"Eyes began to dart;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l027","ordinal":114833,"en":"His legs began to dangle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l028","ordinal":114834,"en":"Azhybai, Bakai and Almambet"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l029","ordinal":114835,"en":"Watched in anguish."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l030","ordinal":114836,"en":"Kökchököz, the nimble leopard:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l031","ordinal":114837,"en":"“I will capture him alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l032","ordinal":114838,"en":"To the khagan's Chynchy Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l033","ordinal":114839,"en":"To the strong fortress with forty gates,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l034","ordinal":114840,"en":"To the khagan's dark city,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l035","ordinal":114841,"en":"I will take him alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l036","ordinal":114842,"en":"Into a dungeon forty rope-lengths deep"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l037","ordinal":114843,"en":"I will take and cast him.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l038","ordinal":114844,"en":"Not yet come to full strength,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0494:b004:l039","ordinal":114845,"en":"From young gray-maned Syrgak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l001","ordinal":114846,"en":"That is how I shall take revenge!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l002","ordinal":114847,"en":"Of Khan Manas's forty noble companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l003","ordinal":114848,"en":"I shall leave not one alive;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l004","ordinal":114849,"en":"To these Buruts standing here"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l005","ordinal":114850,"en":"I shall do all I know how!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l006","ordinal":114851,"en":"Against Syrgak, swaying there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l007","ordinal":114852,"en":"His golden-cheeked battle-axe"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l008","ordinal":114853,"en":"Kökchököz took up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l009","ordinal":114854,"en":"And struck four times with it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l010","ordinal":114855,"en":"Arkesken, the black steel sword,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l011","ordinal":114856,"en":"Syrgak the panther took in hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l012","ordinal":114857,"en":"Of Kökchököz's spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l013","ordinal":114858,"en":"He broke two in succession."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l014","ordinal":114859,"en":"They stood in single combat;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l015","ordinal":114860,"en":"Young Syrgak, that noble hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l016","ordinal":114861,"en":"Fought seven days without a rest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l017","ordinal":114862,"en":"Then came Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l018","ordinal":114863,"en":"Who had entered the caliph's presence and received a writ,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l019","ordinal":114864,"en":"Become a disciple of twelve spiritual guides,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l020","ordinal":114865,"en":"And earned the name of Supremely Renowned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l021","ordinal":114866,"en":"Wolf-man Almambet, the outstanding one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l022","ordinal":114867,"en":"Whose heroic mettle stood apart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l023","ordinal":114868,"en":"Struck Sarala on the flank,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l024","ordinal":114869,"en":"Crying, “Dear Syrgak!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l025","ordinal":114870,"en":"Spurring the courser Aisarala"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l026","ordinal":114871,"en":"This way and that,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l027","ordinal":114872,"en":"Lashing right and left,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l028","ordinal":114873,"en":"He arrived before an arrow could."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l029","ordinal":114874,"en":"Reaching Kökchököz,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l030","ordinal":114875,"en":"That consummate wrestler, that swine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l031","ordinal":114876,"en":"With the painted spear in his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l032","ordinal":114877,"en":"His waist bent over beyond it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l033","ordinal":114878,"en":"His rib bones jutting out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l034","ordinal":114879,"en":"Without looking round,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l035","ordinal":114880,"en":"Without the slightest care for his life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l036","ordinal":114881,"en":"Almambet shouted and thrust."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l037","ordinal":114882,"en":"The Kalmyk did not even sway:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l038","ordinal":114883,"en":"Skilled on horseback, swift on foot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b003:l039","ordinal":114884,"en":"A mighty wrestler in state service."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l001","ordinal":114885,"en":"Almambet stood upon the height;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l002","ordinal":114886,"en":"The Chinese stretched out and thrust;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l003","ordinal":114887,"en":"Almambet the lion did not flinch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l004","ordinal":114888,"en":"The Chinese braced himself;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l005","ordinal":114889,"en":"Almambet stretched out and thrust;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l006","ordinal":114890,"en":"The Chinese did not stir."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l007","ordinal":114891,"en":"They thrust in turn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l008","ordinal":114892,"en":"Taking their turns in order."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l009","ordinal":114893,"en":"Their spears shattered"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l010","ordinal":114894,"en":"Against the Chinese, foremost in strength,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l011","ordinal":114895,"en":"Almambet and Syrgak fought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l012","ordinal":114896,"en":"The Chinese watching them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l013","ordinal":114897,"en":"Drew their bows like rain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l014","ordinal":114898,"en":"Shooting more thickly than hail."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l015","ordinal":114899,"en":"Kökchököz's nine sons,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l016","ordinal":114900,"en":"Their very fame struck fear into those who saw them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l017","ordinal":114901,"en":"Fivefold beyond their father,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l018","ordinal":114902,"en":"They had studied wondrous arts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l019","ordinal":114903,"en":"Kökchököz's nine sons"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l020","ordinal":114904,"en":"Came swooping down"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l021","ordinal":114905,"en":"My wolf-men Almambet and Syrgak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l022","ordinal":114906,"en":"They surrounded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l023","ordinal":114907,"en":"Look at the rain, look at the fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l024","ordinal":114908,"en":"From those dogs, every one a wrestler,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l025","ordinal":114909,"en":"Look at the missiles raining down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l026","ordinal":114910,"en":"Look at the fiercely burning embers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l027","ordinal":114911,"en":"Look at the missiles striking without a break."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l028","ordinal":114912,"en":"Moon-banners, red standards,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l029","ordinal":114913,"en":"A burning haze ahead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l030","ordinal":114914,"en":"Shrill cries and clamor."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l031","ordinal":114915,"en":"Almambet and Syrgak—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l032","ordinal":114916,"en":"When Kökchököz and the nine he led"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l033","ordinal":114917,"en":"Surrounded them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l034","ordinal":114918,"en":"Hardship no man had seen"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l035","ordinal":114919,"en":"They brought upon those noble heads."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l036","ordinal":114920,"en":"The gray haze, the burning dust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l037","ordinal":114921,"en":"So thick, it seemed, that nothing could be seen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l038","ordinal":114922,"en":"Settled to the ground;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0495:b004:l039","ordinal":114923,"en":"The two khans, Ajybai and Bakai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l001","ordinal":114924,"en":"They charged without a pause;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l002","ordinal":114925,"en":"The Muslims swept over the field."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l003","ordinal":114926,"en":"Before those Muslims arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l004","ordinal":114927,"en":"Fine steeds among all horses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l005","ordinal":114928,"en":"Sharing death, their lives as one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l006","ordinal":114929,"en":"Almambet and Syrgak fought together."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l007","ordinal":114930,"en":"Drawing their bows like rain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l008","ordinal":114931,"en":"The dogs had rushed them all at once;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l009","ordinal":114932,"en":"Unable to find a way out, Almambet the lion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l010","ordinal":114933,"en":"Was hard-pressed there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l011","ordinal":114934,"en":"Kökchököz's sons"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l012","ordinal":114935,"en":"Almambet and Syrgak together"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l013","ordinal":114936,"en":"They had surrounded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l014","ordinal":114937,"en":"Here was their intent:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l015","ordinal":114938,"en":"To the Khakan's Old Khan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l016","ordinal":114939,"en":"They would drive them alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l017","ordinal":114940,"en":"From the panther himself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l018","ordinal":114941,"en":"To take revenge in that far land."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l019","ordinal":114942,"en":"Wearing his blue lynx-fur cap,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l020","ordinal":114943,"en":"Your wolf-man elder, Khan Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0496:b003:l021","ordinal":114944,"en":"Came straight into the fray."}]
